---
title: "Starting a Kitchen in the Mountain Valley"
description: "Why we started cooking seriously once we moved somewhere with real seasons."
date: "2026-08-15"
author: "DevInTheMtn"
tags: ["essay", "kitchen"]
---

Starting a kitchen farther from a major city has changed how i cook and shop.

The plan is simple: recipes that hold up in a small kitchen, and a blog where we write about what's actually working — the failed loaves, the chili that got better on day two, the produce swaps that make winter cooking less bleak.

More recipes and posts going up as we cook through the fall.
